  "prefLabel": "Per 1202.03 Use of Seniority to Resolve Conflicts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 1202.03 Use of Seniority to Resolve Conflicts. Should a conflict arise between 2 or more employees requesting the same period of time, the appointing authority shall, provided all other things are equal, use departmental seniority as the method of resolving the conflict.\n\nSource. #8738, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15; ss by #14436, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES: 12-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/per100-1500.html"
